section.k-page
  section.k-demo
    h2.k-demo__title Headings and text
    div.k-preview.k-preview--block
      div.k-prose
        h1 The Joke Tax Chronicles
        p.lead Once upon a time, in a far-off land, there was a very lazy king who spent all day lounging on his throne.
        h2 The King's Plan
        p The king thought long and hard, and finally came up with a brilliant plan: he would tax the jokes in the kingdom.
        h3 The Joke Tax
        blockquote "After all," he said, "everyone enjoys a good joke, so it is only fair that they pay for the privilege."
        h4 People stopped telling jokes
        ul
          li 1st level of puns: 5 gold coins
          li 2nd level of jokes: 10 gold coins
          li 3rd level of one-liners: 20 gold coins
        p Use
          code  npm run dev
          |  to start, and read
          code  README.md
          |  for the rest.
  section.k-demo
    h2.k-demo__title Sizes
    div.k-preview.k-preview--block
      div.k-prose
        p.large Are you absolutely sure?
        p.small Email address
        p.muted Enter your email address.
